      <div type="clause" n="Af Einl. 49.6">
        <head>Rubrics: AF Af Einl. 49.6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">I. Be ðon þæt mon ne scyle oþrum deman buton swa he wille, þæt him mon deme.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning that one should not judge another except as he wishes that he shall be judged</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">I. Be ðon þæt mon ne scule oðrum déman buton swa he wille, þæt mon him deme.</ab>
